Z||000000||gbv||04-28-2000||02:53 AM||||im considering changing the auto shifter on my fiero. the thing is big, and quite ugly i find. i would like one where its a push button from the top type thing. from which cars can i get this type of shifter and have a pefect fit for the Fiero?<P>thanks||||reg||5
